# Beta

This chapter declares NO `theorems:` block, which is the point of the pair: alpha's
`shared:` must not reach it. So theorem and lemma count independently here, each from 1
and each scoped to chapter 2 ("Theorem 2.1", "Lemma 2.1").

::: {.theorem #thm-beta title="Beta"}
Its own counter, starting over.
:::

::: {.lemma #lem-beta title="Beta helper"}
A separate counter, so this is 2.1 and not 2.2.
:::
